[en.IDEA_C02_MAFIA_EXILE]
Baltimare Gangsters

[en.IDEA_C02_MAFIA_EXILE_desc]
The Business Alliance was captured by the Starlight Resistance, and the gangsters there have come to Baltimare through various channels, seriously affecting the stability of our borders...

[zh.IDEA_C02_MAFIA_EXILE]
巴尔的马流亡黑帮

[zh.IDEA_C02_MAFIA_EXILE_desc]
商业联盟被星光熠熠的抵抗军攻陷了，那里的黑帮通过各种渠道到了巴尔的马，严重影响了我们的边境稳定...
